{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "「blt graph.vol.115」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "表紙・巻頭に登場しています！！！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobBNhcn6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobVm0eg8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobGAYmVX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mob0zQidv.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんか悪い顔してますね〜笑"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobIuyYhN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "久しぶりでとっても嬉しかったのと、　ほのぼのとした撮影でいい写真がたくさんです！　　　　インタビューも　最近のあれこれ話してます、、笑　　　　　ポストカードも3種類あるみたいなので、　チェックしてみてください〜　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　リアルミート&グリート"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobcoI3SV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/moboolRqZ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobC0VGgn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "犬じゃないよ。うさぎだよ。🐇"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobfytZd8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobJ355jy.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ゆうちゃんがライトかざして　明るくしてくれました♡"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobUmvXET.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これは、あいりが撮ってくれた♡"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobds4AOy.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かわいいぞのうさぎを発見しました♡💡"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobK4nKhJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddiesの笑顔が見れて幸せだったよ！　　いつもあたたかい言葉をありがとう。　　もっと頑張ろうと思える瞬間です。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/moblpFYbN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobc2O0Hw.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobaY7e6u.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ久しぶりになっちゃってごめんね、、！　　　　まだ、涼しいけど　これからどんどん暑くなると思うから　体調気をつけてね。　　　　　載せたい写真もたくさんあるので、　また書きます！　　　　明日からも、無理せず　ベストを尽くせますように✨　　　またね！！"}], "source": "official"}